      "note": "Codex reconciliation; PROVISIONAL machine alignment. GMR English remains verbatim; no hgm_gloss promotion. Opening tshad abbreviates valid perception, whereas the ocean's tshad denotes extent. Nominal gnas maps place; the residence verbs map living at English offsets 418 and 721, with the repeated living at 537 left outside. blos retains its complete instrumental form and maps think in the conception of a dwelling place. The three mig shes parents distinguish normal vision, the glass organisms' own vision, and ocean organisms' vision; each has two independently meaningful members. First tshad mar 'gro and mi bzod remain omitted as distributed or unresolved, not null. Only the ocean clause retains valid perception and its constitutive predicate be. Necessity uses the narrower have to without would. The near-god clause keeps the clear words certain, near-gods, weapons, glasses, see and have to, without claiming the complete phor gang or as glasses of water relation. Quantity, repeated participants/water and closing existence/reason wording remain unbanked."
